{"id":2750,"bodyHtml":"<div><div><div><p>为大力弘扬雷锋精神，激励广大青年学子积极投身志愿服务，3月5日，我院在15305Z教室举办“学雷锋，做志愿，共同奋进‘十五五’”主题团日活动，我院全体研究生参与。</p><p><img src=\"/virtual_attach_file.vsb?afc=gL4GLYU8rVLRW2oMzCbMzlbL467U4VokU4A7nl-8nRC4Ul-0gihFp2hmCIa0n1hkMYh7U1hkMNVkM4fVMzr2M7W7MzM7Ul7iUz-anNUiM46FnRVfnz-ZL4TFUz9PUYb/v2rjo4OeoDiAvjAXvD80qIbtpYyPLRGYg4C4ozlJqdunx&oid=1579047909&tid=1002&nid=6395&e=.jpeg\" xmlns:v=\"urn:schemas-microsoft-com:vml\" vsbhref=\"vurl\" vurl=\"/_vsl/FB7DBB6AB70E55F4BD53DAA5A20FD577/D1AE2839/A81C\" vheight=\" 362.259px\" vwidth=\" 483px\" alt=\"\" orisrc=\"/virtual_attach_file.vsb?afc=gL4GLYU8rVLRW2oMzCbMzlbL467U4VokU4A7nl-8nRC4Ul-0gihFp2hmCIa0n1hkMYh7U1hkMNVkM4fVMzr2M7W7MzM7Ul7iUz-anNUiM46FnRVfnz-ZL4TFUz9PUYb/v2rjo4OeoDiAvjAXvD80qIbtpYyPLRGYg4C4ozlJqdunx&oid=1579047909&tid=1002&nid=6395&e=.jpeg\"></p><p>活动中，知行宣讲团成员刘海燕围绕雷锋精神的核心要义与时代内涵展开宣讲，阐释了雷锋精神服务人民、助人为乐、敬业奉献的本质内涵，强调新时代雷锋精神体现为信念坚定、勇于创新、甘于奉献。同时，她结合国家“十五五”规划蓝图，深入探讨在新时代背景下，青年一代如何继承和发扬雷锋精神，将个人理想融入国家发展大局，以实际行动为中国式现代化建设贡献青春力量。</p><p><img src=\"/virtual_attach_file.vsb?afc=gUzLLPUmUZo7WfMMznRozNbnRC4oz7oaLlWVLNUDM87Zoz-0gihFp2hmCIa0UYyin1hVLky4nRUZUz6kUNQRolLDMRfVM7lPL7M2o7LYL7QFUm7YLm-8L8QFnlliLSb/v2rjo4OeoDiAvjAXvD80qIbtpYyPLRGYg4C4ozlJqdunx&oid=1579047909&tid=1002&nid=6395&e=.jpeg\" xmlns:v=\"urn:schemas-microsoft-com:vml\" vsbhref=\"vurl\" vurl=\"/_vsl/C5FE03D48A7BBFC9C640E4E10CF8C20F/B122243F/EE51\" vheight=\"\" vwidth=\" 460px\" alt=\"\" orisrc=\"/virtual_attach_file.vsb?afc=gUzLLPUmUZo7WfMMznRozNbnRC4oz7oaLlWVLNUDM87Zoz-0gihFp2hmCIa0UYyin1hVLky4nRUZUz6kUNQRolLDMRfVM7lPL7M2o7LYL7QFUm7YLm-8L8QFnlliLSb/v2rjo4OeoDiAvjAXvD80qIbtpYyPLRGYg4C4ozlJqdunx&oid=1579047909&tid=1002&nid=6395&e=.jpeg\"></p><p>本次宣讲内容贴近青年实际，既增强了同学们对雷锋精神的理解，也激发了大家投身志愿服务的热情。大家表示，将以实际行动赓续雷锋精神，让志愿服务蔚然成风，为奋进“十五五”贡献青春力量。</p></div></div></div>","bodyText":"","attachments":[],"image":"http://mkszyxy.nuc.edu.cn/virtual_attach_file.vsb?afc=gL4GLYU8rVLRW2oMzCbMzlbL467U4VokU4A7nl-8nRC4Ul-0gihFp2hmCIa0n1hkMYh7U1hkMNVkM4fVMzr2M7W7MzM7Ul7iUz-anNUiM46FnRVfnz-ZL4TFUz9PUYb/v2rjo4OeoDiAvjAXvD80qIbtpYyPLRGYg4C4ozlJqdunx&oid=1579047909&tid=1002&nid=6395&e=.jpeg"}